data: {"id": "868d07b35e914e72-final", "run_id": "868d07b35e914e72", "seq": 1195, "ts_ms": 1788787381836, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b 处于 CrashLoopBackOff，重启14次，退出码2 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `status: CrashLoopBackOff`; `waiting_reason: CrashLoopBackOff`; `waiting_message: back-off 5m0s restarting failed container=app pod=workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b` | 定义异常现象与当前状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `last_terminated_reason: Error`; `last_exit_code: 2`; `restart_count: 14` | 指示容器进程非零退出，确认为 CrashLoop 模式 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `BackOff restarting failed container app` (重复 226 次) | 确认 kubelet 持续执行重启回退操作 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `resource_limit.cpu: 200m`; `resource_limit.memory: 96Mi` | 提供资源配置背景（非硬限制上限） |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason = 1` (reason: `CrashLoopBackOff`); `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total = 14` | 独立度量指标印证 K8s 状态与重启次数 |\n| 6 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `runtime process exiting` (http_status: 500, path: `/work`); 发生 3 次，时间范围 2026-09-07 13:02 ~ 13:13 | 捕捉到进程崩溃前的最后一次 HTTP 错误日志 |\n| 7 | Tracing | Deepflow | DNS 查询 `lgtm.monitor.svc.aiops-case-06.svc.cluster.local` response_code: 3 (NXDOMAIN) 持续至最后记录 | 存在网络/服务发现故障，但与崩溃时间点未形成因果锁定 |\n\n证据表明应用进程因内部原因（Exit Code 2）持续崩溃，Kubernetes 按策略不断重启。Metric 独立确认了重启趋势。日志显示崩溃前存在 HTTP 500 错误，但未能定位到具体的 Python 异常类型（如 ImportError）。DNS 解析失败记录提示环境存在潜在不稳定因素，但未直接证明是导致 CrashLoop 的唯一根因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用代码或环境存在运行时缺陷（如未捕获异常） → Python server.py 进程发生致命错误导致 exitCode=2 → Kubelet 检测进程退出并触发重启逻辑 → 触发 BackOff 策略导致 Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：`server.py` 进程在执行过程中发生未捕获的致命运行时错误（导致 Exit Code 2），使得容器不断退出并被 Kubelet 重启，最终进入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态。\n\n证据编号引用：\n- K8s 状态确认 CrashLoopBackOff 及 Exit Code 2：[1, 2, 3]\n- Metric 独立确认重启计数与状态：[5]\n- 日志捕捉到崩溃前的错误退出信息：[6]\n\n证据不足的环节：\n- 具体是哪种 Python 异常（如 `ImportError`, `KeyError` 或其他未处理异常）导致 `server.py` 退出并未在现有日志或堆栈中显现，缺失详细的 Traceback 或崩溃前完整日志。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 51.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b: 51.4s (Evidence 42.9s, RCA 8.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 84.727, "metrics": {"run_id": "868d07b35e914e72", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 84.73281955718994, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "51%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 95%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 84732.81955718994, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 81249.28164482117, "tool_calls": 8, "executed_tool_calls": 8, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 8, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7685.4681968688965, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3030.6437015533447}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 21696.14887237549, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 51445.60527801514, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11570.980310440063, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

